trong>输出物体：</strong>一张绿色的纸，上面什么也没写。</p> <p><strong>笔记：</strong>N/A</p> </div> <div class="blockquote" style="border-radius: 10px; margin: 10px"> <p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">##实验CN1999J-3</span></p> <p><strong>输入SCP：</strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-155">SCP-CN-155</a></p> <p><strong>输出物体：</strong>一把木制弓箭。</p> <p><strong>笔记：</strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">有什么关联吗？</span></p> </div> <div class="blockquote" style="border-radius: 10px; margin: 10px"> <p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">##实验CN1999J-4</span></p> <p><strong>输入SCP：</strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1977">SCP-CN-1977</a></p> <p><strong>输出物体：</strong>一件红色中式现代衣柜</p> <p><strong>笔记：</strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">没什么新意。</span></p> </div> <div class="blockquote" style="border-radius: 10px; margin: 10px"> <p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">##实验CN1999J-5</span></p> <p><strong>输入SCP：</strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-573">SCP-CN-573</a></p> <p><strong>输出物体：</strong>一张油画，上面描述的是食用油。</p> <p><strong>笔记：</strong>N/A</p> </div> <div class="blockquote" style="border-radius: 10px; margin: 10px"> <p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">##实验CN1999J-6</span></p> <p><strong>输入SCP：</strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-433">SCP-CN-433</a></p> <p><strong>输出物体：</strong>Site-CN-90</p> <p><strong>笔记：</strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">无论如何，这不会符合逻辑。</span></p> </div> <div class="blockquote" style="border-radius: 10px; margin: 10px"> <p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">##实验CN1999J-7</span></p> <p><strong>输入SCP：</strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1999-j">SCP-CN-1999-J</a></p> <p><strong>输出物体：</strong>一个标准立方体，尺寸为3m3m3m。</p> <p><strong>笔记：</strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">&#8230;&#8230;</span></p> </div> <blockquote> <h2><span>Footnotes</span></h2> <p><br /> 1.无限制。</p> </blockquote> </div> <p><em>&#8230;what？</em></p> <p><